Homepage: https://diwall.davalan.fr

Package: diwall
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser, python3, python3-venv, python3-pip, fuse3, gocryptfs
Description: Playwright-based visual perception and RPA tool for LLM agents
 Diwall gives an LLM agent eyes (screenshots, Set-of-Mark annotation,
 accessibility tree) and hands (Playwright-driven actions) on web
 interfaces it cannot otherwise see or operate.
 .
 This package installs Diwall under /opt/diwall/ alongside the existing
 git-clone + install.sh distribution channel — the two are independent
 and mutually exclusive on a single machine.
 .
 Network access is required during installation: the postinst step
 creates a Python virtual environment, installs dependencies via pip,
 and downloads the Chromium browser binary via Playwright.
